priority is 0-1. speechDecisionVector contains exactly one saySomethingNow item with score 0-100 and confidence 0-1.
When speaking, spokenText contains 1-3 ordered chunks and usually 2-5 sentences total. It may include what she says, what she physically or magically does to/with the Last Cat, and a question or invitation. When not speaking, use spokenText=[].
